<h3 id="long-lived-near-transition-fire"><a class="heading-anchor" href="/game-of-life-tribes/wiki/wildfire-analysis#long-lived-near-transition-fire" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a>Long-Lived Near-Transition Fire</h3>
